  "question": {
    "text": "If the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></msup></math> is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to_____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8734;</mo></msup></math></p><p>Hence,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math><br />Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Using L&#39;Hospital Rule</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><menclose notation=\"box\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></menclose></math></p>"
